## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical data quality, governance, rollback, and per-tenant isolation on GCP, with real components like Pub/Sub, Dataflow, BigQuery, Cloud Storage, Data Catalog, and time-travel. It also tests how to surface quality signals to dashboards and maintain lineage.

## Key Concepts

- Data quality framework per tenant (schema conformance, null checks, dedupe)
- Per-tenant isolation in BigQuery
- Data Catalog lineage and contract testing
- Rollback using BigQuery time travel and snapshots
- Testing strategy and drift monitoring

## Code Example

```javascript
// Sample validation stub for a record
function validate(rec){
  if(!rec.tenant_id) throw new Error("missing tenant_id");
  if(rec.event_time == null) return false;
  return true;
}
```

